{"id":"vod_sn_38956","vodId":"38956","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"戴拿奥特曼 国语版","name_cn":"戴拿奥特曼 国语版","date":"1997-01-01","year":"1997","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/b08f5c7d65ff9eb869c464c84389f3db.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在2017年的地球，飞鸟信（鹤野刚士 饰）的父亲飞鸟一马是一名宇航员，在一次任务之中下落不明，长大后的信继承了父亲对正义的追求，成为了地球和平联合组织的一员，在学习和训练之中展现出了过人的实力，甚至打败了王牌飞行员由美村良（齐藤理沙 饰）。　　在由美的推荐下，信成为了SUPER GUTS中的一员，肩负起了对抗外星人保卫地球的重任。斯菲亚和岩石合体成为了拥有强大破坏力的怪兽，信和队友们和它展开了激烈的斗争，然而双方实力悬殊绝大，信陷入了岌岌可危的境地，在这千钧一发之际，信变身成为了光之巨人，战斗力陡增，瞬间结果了敌人。之后，信便以光之巨人的身份走上了伸张正义之路。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":51,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/AdAMCYfUV51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/qcM6XVhrYE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Jt4s0WH7UQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/4cfBQKQwUx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/050WRSZ0wZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/0Ek9gwn5nz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/YaQBdH3nqB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/BuzmGdqCWD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/128u26tEwU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Y1wS0ftqg81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/epU61Spdkx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Xab4W6dgv61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/WctmWMigAX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/aRr51DmDQU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"na